    "title": "SPCA Closed Sept. 26 for Paws in the Park Event",
    "text": "21 hours ago The SPCA Serving Erie County is closed on September 26, 2026 while staff take part in Paws in the Park at Knox Farm State Park . Walk-up registration is welcome for people who want to join the event at the park on the morning of September 26, 2026 . More information: https://secure.qgiv.com/event/pitp26/\nThis content is adapted from materials provided by The SPCA Serving Erie County, NY\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
